id: battlefield-doctor
name: Battlefield Doctor
talentCategory: skill
prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in the Medicine Skill
description: >
  You are adept in medicine, allowing you to easily treat any maladies.
text: >
  Battlefield Doctor: You are adept in medicine, allowing you to easily treat any maladies.
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in the Medicine Skill
  (1)-[Triggered]: Upon using the Treatment Maneuver, you can target yourself instead of an Ally within your Melee Range.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When you use the Treatment Maneuver, you may remove a Combat Condition from the target (except Suffocating, Pinned, or Transfigured).

---

[passive]
# (1) The Treatment aimed at yourself - your own token targeted, or none (use-maneuver.mjs, where its target is resolved).
allow treatment.self;
# (2) Asked as the Treatment is used, once a Round - the player's to choose: which of the target's Combat Conditions comes off,
# Suffocating, Pinned and Transfigured never offered; said on its roll (use-maneuver.mjs askDoctorRemoval).
allow treatment.removeCondition;
